Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}ほら。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}ウソ…。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧……
